                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "lnXST",
                              "name": "Working",
                              "context": "Working indicator. While the agent runs, the spinner is followed by the elapsed run time — never a static 'Working…' label. Elapsed time is the only status this row carries: it is the one thing a static label cannot tell you, and it is how you judge whether a run is stuck.\n\nMono ($font-mono) so the digits do not jitter as they tick. Format is compact and drops empty leading units: '4s', '48s', '10m 20s', '1h 04m'. Counts from the start of the current run and freezes on completion.",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "gap": 7,
                              "padding": [
