                  "fill": "$ds-fg-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1240,
                  "content": "Agents finish, checks fail, reviews land — all while you are somewhere else. Every one of those events points at a resource that already exists in the hierarchy, so the panel showing them is not a new mechanism. It holds only what is still unresolved: answer it, snooze it or mark it done and it leaves for Activity, where things that happened live. What is open is the shape of the room. Four designs, drawn at size.",
