                  "fill": "$ds-fg-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1100,
                  "content": "Settings is not resource-owned, and it is not mode-owned either — every slot is declared by a mode, so any slot it were given could be taken away by the next one. It occupies no slot at all: an overlay above the frame, reachable in every mode, with its own sections nav. The workbench is untouched underneath — same mode, same selection, same panels — and closing returns you exactly there.",
