                  "fill": "$ds-fg-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Rows nest under their group header and carry every attribute the board shows — state ring, id, labels, priority, target date, assignee. Density is the point: 34px rows, a fixed-width id column so titles align down the page, and a single hairline between rows instead of a card around each one. Collapsing a group hides its rows, not its count.",
