          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Nav Chrome owns history, breadcrumbs, resource actions, and closed-Panel recovery. Every Panel owns a same-height Panel Header, tabs, add-panel control, content, and optional left/right menus. Logical Panel identity survives swapping and movement.",
