                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "$tree-fill steps transparent → $ds-surface-hover → $ds-surface; $tree-fg lifts $ds-fg-muted → $ds-fg. Focus-visible reuses the hover fill — the whole tree is a single Tab stop with a roving tabindex, so focus is always exactly one row. Disabled rows mute label and icon to $ds-fg-subtle, drop the pointer, and are skipped by arrow keys. Danger-tone rows ink label and icon in $ds-error and outline 1px in $ds-error on hover instead of filling.",
