                      "fill": "$ds-fg-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "$tree-pl: 8 / 26 / 44 — an 18px step per level. Containers spend 14px of it on the chevron plus 7px gap; leaves skip the chevron and take the next stop outright, so icons and labels rail vertically. The compact row variant (menus, pickers, dense sidebars) drops to 28px tall with 14px icons; the tree variant shown everywhere here is 30px with 15px icons.",
