                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "A VS Code-style icon theme contributes font glyphs and colors. Resolution: exact filename match first (package.json), then the longest compound extension (d.ts beats ts), then the theme's file / folder defaults. The @font-faces inject once per theme into a tagged style element; when no theme is active, the Lucide map on the left takes over — in $tree-fg, never colored.",
