                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "UGCsH",
                  "name": "cmp/DataTableSurfaceToolbar",
                  "context": "Internal compact toolbar for standalone table surfaces. The canonical cmp/DataTable renderer hides this row and uses cmp/ViewBar instead. Its Filter and Display affordances intentionally match the shared renderer controls.",
